schema_version: '1.0'
schema_type: project_graph
project_id: agentos-dashboard
project_name: AgentOS Dashboard — LifeOS web command center
description: 'Build the AgentOS/LifeOS Dashboard per Sab''s plan (research/agentos-plan.md,
  from the Rubric Agentic OS video breakdown): a standalone web command center — React
  + Vite + Tailwind + Canvas/D3 — with an artifact orbit ring, a radial second-brain
  DAG, a headless skills deck, and a routines board, backed by a workspace watcher
  that parses router markdown + frontmatter into a graph.json and a /api/skills/run
  endpoint with live SSE/WebSocket logs.'
repo: local (new app; repo location settled in node 01)
blueprint:
  vision: 'A production-ready interactive command center over Sab''s real environment
    — vaults (SSD), artifacts, routines, agents — learned while building. The plan
    is a spec derived from a video; the graph turns it into bounded deliverables with
    evidence: schema, watcher, shell, orbit, DAG, skills deck, routines board, API,
    live integration, dogfood, rollout.'
  architecture_notes: 'Settled during charting (2026-08-23, plan source: sab-air /Users/sab-mini/Obsidian/SSD/00
    Inbox/AgentOS Dashboard - LifeOS Dashboard.md): Two center modes — Mode A artifact
    orbit (ring of generated outputs, search/highlight filter, click-to-HUD with metadata/path/Open/Remove/Close)
    and Mode B radial DAG (root router → domain hubs → leaf skills/artifacts/routines/apps;
    force/circle/hex/ concentric layouts, physics sliders). Perimeter widgets: top
    fuzzy search, left micro-apps launcher + clock, right email digest + skills deck
    (model + effort selectors, headless claude -p execution) + routines firing board
    (next/queued/fired, local vs cloud worker, sync). Backend: Node/Python watcher
    daemon → graph.json from router markdown + YAML/JSON frontmatter; /api/skills/run;
    SSE/WebSocket log piping. Theme #0c0d10 with #ff6b35/#f59e0b/#38bdf8 accents.
    Charted as 12 capability nodes; "expect the rest to be learned while building"
    lives inside nodes, not in the chart. Data sources (which vaults, which artifact
    dirs, which routines) are settled in node 01, not assumed.'
  major_capabilities:
  - artifact orbit with search filter + HUD inspection
  - radial DAG with 4 layouts + physics controls
  - headless skills deck (model/effort selectors)
  - routines board with sync status
  - workspace watcher → graph.json
  - /api/skills/run + live log streaming
  - live integration, dogfood, rollout plan
graph_version: '1.0'
